OWSCENARIO 1
world "pilot.owgeo"
# @name "Central Korea inland pilot (36 formations per faction)"
# @description "Two fictional task forces rotate independent formations across northern and central approaches over a 72-hour campaign."

# Coordinates are local map millimetres at existing imported road nodes. All military sites are fictional.
